sequenceDiagram
    participant C as 앱·웹
    participant S as 서버
    participant G as LangGraph
    C->>S: POST /api/chat {text}
    S->>G: 그래프 실행
    G-->>S: progress 이벤트들
    S-->>C: progress, progress ...
    G-->>S: interrupt (멈춤)
    S-->>C: interrupt {interrupt_id, kind, ...}
    Note over C: 사용자 답 또는 폰이 KB 처리
    C->>S: POST /api/chat/resume {interrupt_id, payload}
    S->>G: Command(resume=payload)
    G-->>S: 다음 progress / interrupt / 끝
    S-->>C: message, done
